From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:23:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 402/488] Dispatch the remaining generation controls to
 TileLang

Min-p, logit bias, forbidden sequences, the thinking budget's marker cache
and budget, prompt-logprob token ids, custom logprob token ids and the NaN
count. Each is bit-exact with its Triton kernel, which stays as the tests'
reference; the thinking budget and the NaN count are now declared at
startup (the latter only when NaN counting is on), as the frozen kernel
cache requires.
---
